OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist risked lives of
OL,4,Aneighbours with house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arsonist who could have endangered
OL,7,Fthe lives of elderly neighbours when he
OL,8,Fset fire to his mother's house has been
OL,9,Fjailed for two years and eight months.
OL,11,FAlfie Mavin, 26, jumped out of a
OL,12,Fbedroom window to escape the blaze he
OL,13,Fstarted at a semi-detached house in
OL,14,FDurham in February, Teesside Crown
OL,15,FCourt heard.
OL,17,FBelieve Housing, which owns the
OL,18,Fproperty, said the fire did more than
OL,19,F#40,000 worth of damage and had cost
OL,20,F#25,000 in insurance excess.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
