OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist risked lives of
OL,4,Aneighbours with house fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMavin, who had 38 offences on his
OL,7,Fcriminal record, admitted arson being
OL,8,Freckless as to whether life was
OL,9,Fendangered.
